        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Elevating Teton Valley through Grants</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47036.webp" alt="Elevating Teton Valley through Grants" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>With your support in 2023, the Community Foundation awarded over $100,000 to local organizations, elevating 35 unique projects across Teton Valley. Whether helping those in need through rental assistance and food security, providing resources for recreation, wellness, and art opportunities, or supporting mental health and community needs, one of the Foundation’s greatest assets for impact is our grant program. The Competitive Grants, Youth Philanthropy, and Opportunities Fund support the important work of our critical nonprofit partners, making a significant contribution to the Teton Valley community.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Youth Philanthropy is one of our most heart-warming and empowering grant programs. Over sixty participating seniors provided insight and inspiration throughout their thoughtful and respectful decision-making process this year. Watch this quick video to see the power of philanthropy first-hand:</p>

<p>We are proud to be part of a community that values collaboration, generosity, and positive impact. Thank you to all who have supported our efforts and helped make these grants and more possible.</p>

<h3>Please consider the Community Foundation in your year-end giving to create even more impact.</h3>

<a href="https://cfjh.iphiview.com/cfjh/DonorView/AccountInformation/tabid/495/dispatch/accountselection_id$10906_hash$1c0c71b9a8078a604dbdfa2c94b19b5566a479d2/Default.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Donate Now!</a>

<h3>Other Ways to Give:</h3>

<ul>
<li><strong>Give the Gift of Community:</strong>&nbsp;<a href="https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcftetonvalley.us1.list-manage.com%2Ftrack%2Fclick%3Fu%3D68e68490fdddc7a44915a9c7a%26id%3D778ae7eccb%26e%3D7003933c73&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ccvitucci%40cftetonvalley.org%7Caefb80e10dfc469ace5a08dbf76fcf23%7Cb04f1710b73341a3ab06600205b83e57%7C0%7C0%7C638375831834474409%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=0qiat%2BwTcGjpepoabS5SXIhhyYJK%2F%2BCqyxDjjWpADPo%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Make a gift</a>&nbsp;in honor of someone, and we will send them a lovely card letting them know of your generous contribution. Donations can also be sent to the Community Foundation of Teton Valley, P.O. Box 1523, Driggs, ID 83422.<br></li>

