<li><strong>Donations of Stocks or Securities:</strong>&nbsp;Donations of appreciated&nbsp;<a href="https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcftetonvalley.us1.list-manage.com%2Ftrack%2Fclick%3Fu%3D68e68490fdddc7a44915a9c7a%26id%3D889692f7b0%26e%3D7003933c73&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ccvitucci%40cftetonvalley.org%7Caefb80e10dfc469ace5a08dbf76fcf23%7Cb04f1710b73341a3ab06600205b83e57%7C0%7C0%7C638375831834474409%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=f%2BVsg5JKmnMSNJtET%2FUbhBVYXPAlQTCW5dB6cOahsBA%3D&amp;reserved=0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">stocks or securities</a>&nbsp;could help you avoid paying federal and state capital gains tax.<br></li>

